.TH SHAGOFF-COMMANDER 1 "2026" "Shagoff Commander" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
shagoff-commander \- Total Commander-style dual-pane file manager for COSMIC
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shagoff-commander
.RI [ dir ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Shagoff Commander
is a dual-pane file manager for the COSMIC desktop, written with libcosmic.
Its layout and keys follow Total Commander for Windows: two panels with tabs, F-key operations,
archives (zip, tar.*, 7z) opened as folders, file search, directory sync and compare, network
mounts through gvfs, a viewer, a command line and a built-in terminal.
.PP
With
.I dir
the left panel opens there; otherwise both panels open where they were left.
.SH KEYS
Press F1 in the program for the full list. The main ones:
.TP
.B Tab
Switch panel.
.TP
.B Insert, Space, Num+, Num\-, Num*
Mark files (operations apply to the marked files, else to the one under the cursor).
.TP
.B F3, F4
View, edit.
.TP
.B F5, F6, Shift+F6
Copy, move, rename.
.TP
.B F7, F8, Shift+F8
New folder, delete to trash, delete permanently.
.TP
.B Alt+F1, Alt+F2
Drive list of the left / right panel.
.TP
.B Alt+F5, Alt+F9
Pack, unpack.
.TP
.B Alt+Shift+F5
Move to archive: pack, then delete the sources.
.TP
.B Alt+F7
Find files.
.TP
.B Ctrl+D
Directory hotlist.
.TP
.B Ctrl+F
Connect to a server (sftp, smb, ftp, dav).
.TP
.B Ctrl+T, Ctrl+W
New tab, close tab.
.TP
.B Ctrl+`, Ctrl+O
Built-in terminal on / off, terminal over the whole window.
.TP
.B Ctrl+,
Settings.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/cosmic/io.github.shagovAlexei.cosmic-shagoff-commander/v1/
Settings, one file per field; a change made by hand applies at once.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/cosmic/io.github.shagovAlexei.cosmic-shagoff-commander/v1/
Tabs, paths and histories, kept between runs.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ICED_BACKEND
.B tiny-skia
forces the software renderer (chosen by itself on a GPU that cannot run the default one).
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Log level on standard error (default
.BR warn ).
.TP
.B SHELL
The built-in terminal's shell, unless another is chosen in Commands \(-> Shell.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gio (1),
.BR xdg-open (1)
.PP
